            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four wizards. One arena. One very angry ball.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards is a spiritual successor to Warlords, the four-player arena classic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you hold your ground, deflect what's coming, and outlast everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shields still orbit. The ball still screams across the field. But now every</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mage carries a spellbook, and no rally survives contact with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your library. Break theirs. Last wizard standing takes the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The old discipline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shield sweeps around your position in a tight arc, and that arc is the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whole game. Read the ball's angle, commit early, and send it back harder than</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it came. Every deflection is tracked to the wizard who made it, so when the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ball finally lands, everyone knows exactly whose fault it was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The new chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five spells turn a clean rally into a scramble:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireball</strong>: a burning projectile hurled straight across the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice Bolt</strong>: freeze a rival at the exact moment they need to move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pentacle</strong>: arcane geometry that rewrites the flow of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield</strong>: the half-second of protection that saves your corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Duplication</strong>: one incoming threat was never enough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Opponents with opinions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any empty slot fills with an AI wizard drawn from five distinct combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >personalities: Rookie, Veteran, Aggressive, Defensive, and Chaotic. Learn the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >angles against a Rookie. Then see how many seconds you last against Chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring three friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards runs on a purpose-built Steam networking layer with host-authoritative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >match simulation, so deflections land where they should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Play</strong>: drop into an open lobby instantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Private Host</strong>: a room just for your group.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join by Code</strong>: share a code, everyone's in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your mage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your wizard and skin from the main menu, step into the arena, and start</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >defending. Matches are short, resets are instant, and there is always a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rematch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At a glance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-wizard arena combat in the Warlords tradition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbiting shield defense with per-player deflection ownership</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 spells that reshape every exchange</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 AI personalities for solo play and slot filling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer via Steam: Quick Play, private lobbies, join-by-code</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast matches, instant resets, endless rematches</p></li></ul>",
